[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 2760.19, "timestamp": "00:46:00", "text": "，大概兩次。我的舊內褲被偷了。所以我總是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2763.109, "timestamp": "00:46:03", "text": "告訴你這件事，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2764.79, "timestamp": "00:46:04", "text": "因為你知道印度的內衣超級便宜。它們看起來很便宜。 300塊大概可以買到三、四條內褲。但在那裡你要支付大約1000日元或2000日元。這種內衣很便宜，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2768.47, "timestamp": "00:46:08", "text": "所以最好隨身攜帶一大包（例如幾十條）內衣，這樣就不用反覆購買了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2772.15, "timestamp": "00:46:12", "text": "。啊啊，所以不穿內褲的人又怎樣又怎樣？你看，我聽得出Johnny"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2774.63, "timestamp": "00:46:14", "text": "前輩真的很純潔。好吧，別讓任何可怕的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2776.95, "timestamp": "00:46:16", "text": "領主掉下來，也別嚇到他。好吧，我不害怕。我不是那個嚇唬人的人。  好吧，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2779.91, "timestamp": "00:46:19", "text": "你們"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2789.79, "timestamp": "00:46:29", "text": "把他嚇到了。  等待。呃，"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 2792.043, "timestamp": "00:46:32", "author": "@relaxbreatheblossomasmr5099", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ckcBBCnJoTgzSBf41z6qIrlbXLgznOucPKQ1RdeSjWdIubetNhA8L40rK7FrC8Ymp_UJfKAA5w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "UCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/KsIfY6LzFoLM6AKanYDQAgUCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/KsIfY6LzFoLM6AKanYDQAgUCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/KsIfY6LzFoLM6AKanYDQAg"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2797.109, "timestamp": "00:46:37", "text": "各位，呃，我不"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2799.109, "timestamp": "00:46:39", "text": "知道該說什麼。我在直播前告訴Johnny Senai，我會告訴大家Po最近經歷了什麼。他很煩。  非常非常煩人，簡直是煩人了。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 2803.306, "timestamp": "00:46:43", "author": "@relaxbreatheblossomasmr5099", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ckcBBCnJoTgzSBf41z6qIrlbXLgznOucPKQ1RdeSjWdIubetNhA8L40rK7FrC8Ymp_UJfKAA5w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "stream private incoming"}]